OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas lights switch-ons across
OL,4,Athe North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's beginning to look a lot like
OL,7,FChristmas in north-west England, as
OL,8,Ftowns and cities in the region light up
OL,9,Ffor the festive season.
OL,11,FAs the countdown to 25 December begins,
OL,12,Fcities and towns across the region have
OL,13,Fset the date to switch on their
OL,14,FChristmas lights, marking the start of
OL,15,Fthe yuletide festivities.
OL,17,FBelow are confirmed details of when and
OL,18,Fwhere events are taking place locally.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
