OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas lights switch-ons across
OL,4,Athe North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthport: The annual ceremony takes
OL,7,Fplace on Saturday 7 November, with free
OL,8,Fentertainment outside The Grand and
OL,9,Fperformances from Regally Royal Parties
OL,10,Ffrom 16:00 GMT.
